// Gap G190 (a), round 4 wave 8 (lane C, C3; Codex diff review round 2): an
// ascription of an AGGREGATE checks its components -- a dense array ascribed
// an opaque `RaggedIdx<_>` inside a tuple hid its provenance (the interpreter
